round-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">577 MB</span></a>\\n</span>&nbsp;\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/vae<br></div><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #ffffff\\\"><h3>Custom Chat GPT</h3><p><span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-rm\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-6a70726c663c81919ff3199d41c73f0e-minimax-h3-prompts\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Custom ChatGPT for H3 Prompting (Beta)</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;After placing the files, restart ComfyUI or refresh model lists using the <b>R</b> shortcut.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Nodes Installed from Manager</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><ul>\\n  <li>Pixaroma</li>\\n</ul><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"pixar