      "PromptState": "{\"text\":\"How the reference pictures align with the target video \u2014 Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video; Picture 2 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 5.00-second mark of the target video.\\n\\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, fashion studio cinematic style, the woman shown in Picture 1 begins facing forward against the neutral studio backdrop. She initiates a smooth 360-degree pirouette, pivoting gracefully on her feet as her red satin dress swirls around her body. As her back turns to the camera, the red satin dress seamlessly transforms into a crisp white short-sleeved t-shirt and high-waisted pink jeans. Completing the full turn back to facing forward, her blonde wavy hair flows naturally through the rotation, and she raises her left hand with small amplitude at slow speed to gently touch and adjust a strand of hair beside her face before resting her arms downward and settling into the exact frontal pose, eye level, neutral lighting, and composition established by Picture 2.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Quiet indoor studio ambience continues throughout with subtle fabric rustle from the turn and soft movement of hair.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: Chic, mid-tempo electronic fashion synth bed with light atmospheric pads and gentle percussion that cleanly resolves at the end.\",\"order\":\"mine\",\"sep\":\", \"}"
